From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roberto Andrei Bolda <rbolda@taladin.ro>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] SCons/Platform: allow overriding the platform with $PLATFORM

Let the PLATFORM environment variable select the SCons platform, so a
cross build can use "posix" regardless of the build host.

Signed-off-by: Roberto Andrei Bolda <rbolda@taladin.ro>
---
 scons-local-4.11.1/SCons/Platform/__init__.py | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

--- a/scons-local-4.11.1/SCons/Platform/__init__.py
+++ b/scons-local-4.11.1/SCons/Platform/__init__.py
@@ -69,6 +69,8 @@ def platform_default():
     care about the machine architecture.
     """
     osname = os.name
+    if 'PLATFORM' in os.environ:
+        return os.environ['PLATFORM']
     if osname == 'java':
         osname = os._osType
     if osname == 'posix':
